    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player RPG</strong>: Immersive story progression enjoyed solo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Collection System</strong>: Meet various heroes during story progression and recruit them as allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Person Party Combat</strong>: Select 4 heroes from your collection to form the optimal party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time/Turn-based Combat</strong>: Strategic battle system adaptable to situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Exploration</strong>: Open-world style otherworld adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Hero Collection</strong>: Dozens of heroes with different classes and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Party Formation</strong>: Fun of organizing 4-person parties considering synergy and roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Collection &amp; Enhancement</strong>: Character customization with hundreds of weapons, armor, and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet System</strong>: Various companions that assist in combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Individual Character Development</strong>: System to independently grow stats and skills of all heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest System</strong>: Rich content with main story and various side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Crafting</strong>: Create stronger equipment and consumables from collected materials</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player RPG</strong>: Immersive story progression enjoyed solo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Collection System</strong>: Meet various heroes during story progression and recruit them as allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Person Party Combat</strong>: Select 4 heroes from your collection to form the optimal party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time/Turn-based Combat</strong>: Strategic battle system adaptable to situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Exploration</strong>: Open-world style otherworld adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Hero Collection</strong>: Dozens of heroes with different classes and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Party Formation</strong>: Fun of organizing 4-person parties considering synergy and roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Collection &amp; Enhancement</strong>: Character customization with hundreds of weapons, armor, and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet System</strong>: Various companions that assist in combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Individual Character Development</strong>: System to independently grow stats and skills of all heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest System</strong>: Rich content with main story and various side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Crafting</strong>: Create stronger equipment and consumables from collected materials</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You, an ordinary high school student, are suddenly pursued by dragon clans and saved by the dark mage Violet. Violet sees your pendant and believes you to be the reincarnation of the legendary hero Myers, taking you to another world.",
